<title>UK: Bayer Hypo adds 100 mln Sfr to April 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo adds 100 mln Sfr to April 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager SBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    16.APR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE  **16.JUL.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/A+    NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFAULT YES</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH 150 MLN SWISS FRANC BOND LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		20.FEB.97.</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 90 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658 (c) Reuters Limited 1997</p>
